{"data":{"body":"**P3 \u2014 Correct the at-most-once flush contract.** `onInvocationEnd` loops until late nonterminal updates are exported and flushed; the added `PENDING`/`RETRYING` regression test explicitly expects two `flush()` calls when an update arrives during the first flush. Exporter authors may therefore make unsafe single-call assumptions. Document that flushes are serialized but may repeat for one invocation, and update the later \u201cruns once for the whole burst\u201d wording accordingly.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs76gMl5","finding_digest":"ad98bfb1562a64ef5e4627bbc186318ffbf18972d44f354cc477992def0affa9","finding_id":"arf_v1_vwml7mkwfjso6xsge654dbrrr7","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-insight/src/types.ts::insightexporter-flush::at-most-once-contract","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-insight/src/types.ts::insightexporter-flush::at-most-once-contract","line":83,"observation_digest":"4e81bdf887aab39e8ef26bcee5dc9d88cc2ef34de82a28703873cb7d4d048d26","observation_id":"aro_v1_j2a336ehvkzz5dxsnpholxe5rd","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-insight/src/types.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T03:23:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_7vld4mlmemhgotnwdcobr6jphn","reviewed_base_sha":"7de88e9c9ef4a9bb0c13a5cae7b6270119276e60","reviewed_head_sha":"2e97d48436869da16b8a8fcc06dab1ef8b3ddc27","reviewer":"codex","start_line":83,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":924},"record_id":"art_v1_c7nqxq2k3pzl5h7zfy6mbs73f6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T03:23:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
